","notes":"Suggested Use: Take 2 softgels daily with a meal. For easier swallowing, take with water before and during ingestion."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Keep bottle tightly closed."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place, out of reach of children.\t"},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place, out of reach of children.\t"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if imprinted seal under cap is broken or missing."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Caution: If you are pregnant or nursing, or taking medication, facing surgery, have bleeding problems, undergoing any other treatment which may affect the ability of blood to clot, consult your physician before taking this product."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains: Fish (anchovy, sardine).\n"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Fish (anchovy, sardine).\n"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Fish Oil Country of Origin is Peru. Encapsulated and quality tested in the U.S.A."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Fish Oil softgels are made to Nature Made's guaranteed purity and potency standards. \nEnteric coated to reduce fish burps. \nBased on Pharmacy Times Survey of pharmacists recommending omega-3/fish oil supplements \n"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease.\t"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"The omega-3s (EPA and DHA) in fish oil help support a healthy heart.\nProvides 600 mg of heart healthy omega-3s (500 mg EPA/DHA) per serving"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Nature Made is the #1 pharmacist recommended brand of Omega-3/Fish Oil"},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Fish Oil should be used with caution when combined with:\nBlood thinning medication (e.g. warfarin and coumadin)\nNonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs (e.g. ibuprofen and aspirin)\nBlood pressure medication"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"When to take\nWith the most substantial meal of the day"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Trust your heart health with Nature Made Fish Oil 1000 mg."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Every 2 softgels provide 600 mg of heart healthy omega-3s (500 mg EPA/DHA)."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Nature Made’s Burp-Less formula Fish Oil is specially coated to help prevent a fishy odor and aftertaste."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Nature Made supports leading heart health experts who recommend eating 500 mg of EPA/DHA per day to help support a healthy heart."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Every 2 softgels provide 500 mg of the omega-3 fatty acids EPA and DHA."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Specially coated to help prevent fish burps."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Nature Made Fish Oil 1000 mg softgel is guaranteed to meet our high quality standards – it is made from carefully selected ingredients under strict manufacturing processes.\nNature Made is the #1 pharmacist recommended omega-3/fish oil brand"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Nature Made’s fish oil supply only comes from deep ocean waters, not farm raised fish"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Available Sizes: 150 Count"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Based on US News & World Report - Pharmacy Times Survey of pharmacists recommending this category.\n“Recommend” amount equates to a calculation based on approximately 3,500 mg of omega-3 fatty acids EPA/DHA found in 2 servings of fatty fish per week.\nState-of-the-art purification processes remove PCBs, dioxins and furans, and mercury to ensure purity levels below 0.09 ppm, 2 ppt WHO TEQs, and 0.1 ppm respectively."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Given that no two people are alike, if you are taking any medications you should be aware that potential drug-nutrient interactions may occur and are encouraged to consult a health care professional before using this product. Combining certain prescription drugs and dietary supplements can lead to undesirable effects such as:\nDiminished drug effectiveness\nReduced supplement effectiveness\nImpaired drug and/or supplement absorption"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"2002 - 2015 Pharmavite LLC. All Rights Reserved."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Gluten Free"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}